1
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:44,280
Deadly trials?

4
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:46,360
What if she can't get through it?

5
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:48,480
Bloodshed and death hang over her.

6
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:50,640
If she cannot get through it,

7
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:53,440
then I'm afraid
her death is fast approaching.

8
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:56,480
She will not live past her twenties.

9
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:58,480
How dare you!

10
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,320
How dare you curse my daughter?

11
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,680
Yi Jiang,

12
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:02,720
how dare you speak such nonsense?

13
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,400
Apologize to Her Ladyship at once.

14
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,480
I spoke frankly.

15
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,120
Please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

16
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:11,160
It's nothing.

17
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:15,800
Nuwa and Fuxi
wanted to take me to paradise.

18
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:17,240
I told them I wouldn't go.

19
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:19,400
I have another 80 years to live.

20
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:24,240
Yi Jiang,
watch closely and see for yourself.

21
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,600
I won't settle for even one day less.

22
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:29,520
I spoke out of turn.
Please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

23
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:34,400
Fortune-telling is just for fun.

24
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:36,880
You needn't take it to heart.

25
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:40,880
Hualou, is your painting finished?

26
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:48,160
Lady Zheng, it's finished.

27
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:56,280
No wonder you're famed
throughout the capital for your talent.

28
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:59,040
It really captures the spirit,

29
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,240
remarkably so.

30
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,240
Attendants, reward her.

31
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:04,520
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

32
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:05,880
AUSPICIOUS DAYS, JOYOUS GATHERINGS

33
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:09,040
I invited Noble Lady Wu'an here today
to discuss another important matter.

34
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:14,480
The Crown Prince is
nearly 30 and still childless.

35
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:19,400
I hear your foster sister
is gentle and virtuous.

36
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:21,880
I'd like her to become
the Crown Prince's secondary consort,

37
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:25,640
so she may bear him children
and continue his line.

38
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:30,320
Your Ladyship, what do you think?

39
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:34,920
My sister cannot speak.
I'm afraid she cannot serve His Highness.

40
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:37,400
Hongxian wasn't born mute.

41
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:40,320
After some treatment
from the imperial physicians,

42
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,440
she'll recover.

43
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:43,640
Hongxian,

44
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:45,760
your sister can't bear to part with you.

45
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,960
But you mustn't be ungrateful.

46
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:50,880
Come now.

47
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,560
Thank Lady Zheng for this honor.

48
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:57,320
Lady Zheng,

49
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,240
Hongxian is already betrothed.

50
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:05,360
Who would dare
offend the heir to the throne?

51
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,840
Have him call off the engagement.

52
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:08,840
Good girl,

53
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,560
it's time to give thanks.

54
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:13,520
Go on.

55
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,200
Stop!

56
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:25,400
I won't allow it!

57
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,080
Noble Lady Wu'an,

58
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:30,240
an imperial offer of marriage
cannot be refused.

59
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:31,880
Do you plan to defy imperial authority

60
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:33,920
for a girl of common birth?

61
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,440
Lady Zheng,

62
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:38,200
Rao and Hongxian share a deep bond.

63
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:40,600
Rao has settled Hongxian's marriage.

64
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,680
Why put her in such a difficult position

65
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:43,960
by insisting on taking her as a consort?

66
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,920
Because the Crown Prince
has taken a fancy to her

67
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:47,720
and insists on taking her as a consort.

68
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:50,320
Hualou,

69
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,520
if the Crown Prince
wanted you as his consort,

70
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,240
how would you react?

71
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,600
I would simply obey.

72
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,600
Did you hear that?

73
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:00,560
When a man of higher
rank wants a lowborn woman,

74
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:02,840
she must simply obey.

75
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,880
Even if you take this to His Majesty,

76
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:08,560
His Majesty will never permit anyone
to defy their betters

77
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:09,880
and disobey the imperial family.

78
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:11,280
That is the law.

79
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:13,000
That is propriety.

80
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,200
I wouldn't dare offend you.

81
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:38,760
Please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

82
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,920
Noble Lady Wu'an,

83
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:49,120
at least you know how to behave.

84
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,600
I have something to tell Your Ladyship.

85
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:59,120
May I come closer to speak?

86
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:12,560
A mother rises in status through her son.

87
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:17,680
The mother of the Crown Prince
is traditionally made Empress.

88
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:20,960
Yet you still
haven't been given that title.

89
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:25,080
So who are you to act
like you're already Empress?

90
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:26,800
How dare you!

91
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:32,160
Rao!

92
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,480
Rao!

93
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,080
You…

94
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:42,240
What have I done to offend Your Ladyship
that you had to strike me like that?

95
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,520
I… I didn't even…

96
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:47,080
You vile woman!
How dare you hurt my daughter?

97
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,320
How dare you hit me?

98
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,000
Mother!

99
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:56,600
Stop!

100
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:58,120
- Stop!
- Mother.

101
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:02,280
What is all this racket?

102
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:10,080
Greetings, Your Majesty.

103
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,120
Your Majesty,

104
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:20,280
Lady Zheng attacked
my daughter without cause.

105
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:23,440
I beg Your Majesty for justice.

106
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:25,240
Did this really happen?

107
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:28,040
Come on. Get up.

108
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:30,480
All of you, rise.

109
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,080
Your Majesty,

110
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,800
the Crown Prince has taken a liking
to Noble Lady Wu'an's foster sister

111
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:40,000
and wishes to take
her as a secondary consort.

112
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:42,640
Lady Zheng kindly offered
to arrange the match, but she…

113
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,280
Your Majesty,

114
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:48,320
Wu'an spoke insolently and humiliated me.

115
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:51,680
All I did was tell Lady Zheng
that Hongxian was already betrothed,

116
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,920
and she slapped me.

117
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,200
I've been wronged.

118
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,160
I beg Your Majesty to judge fairly.

119
00:07:58,240 --> 00:08:00,680
- You clearly said…
- Said what?

120
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:09,280
Lady Wang heard our conversation.

121
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,360
Lady Wang, please tell us what you heard.

122
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,680
Your Majesty,

123
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,080
I was present.

124
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:22,280
I certainly

125
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:26,120
didn't hear anything offensive.

126
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,720
For reasons I don't know,

127
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:30,120
Lady Zheng lost her temper

128
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:32,159
and struck
Noble Lady Wu'an on the right cheek.

129
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:35,200
Xie Hualou, you were there too.

130
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:36,720
Please tell us the truth.

131
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,280
I…

132
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:45,000
I couldn't hear clearly.

133
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:50,680
What exactly have I done wrong?
Please do let me know, Lady Zheng.

134
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:52,480
You…

135
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:58,160
Your Majesty,

136
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:01,240
all I said was that a mother's status
rises with her son's.

137
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,840
- The Crown Prince…
- A mother's status rises with her son's.

138
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:07,320
Once Hongxian enters the Crown Prince's
household and bears a child,

139
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:10,400
His Majesty will reward her handsomely.

140
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,680
Noble Lady Wu'an
will share in that honor too.

141
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:15,040
What's wrong with that?

142
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:20,160
The Crown Prince has taken
a fancy to Wu'an's foster sister?

143
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,080
Where is she?

144
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,320
Raise your head.

145
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:43,360
Your Majesty, my sister is already…

146
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:46,360
Father, forgive me.

147
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,040
This happened because of me.

148
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,880
It's entirely my fault.

149
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:52,960
I often visit my sister,
and I've long had my eye on Hongxian.

150
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:56,560
But since I haven't
taken a principal wife,

151
00:09:57,080 --> 00:10:00,240
my sister feared
you'd think me young and reckless.

152
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:03,240
So she did all she could to conceal it
and dared not comply.

153
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:08,680
Oh, you. That really was unacceptable.

154
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:11,160
How could you let
your sister take the blame?

155
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:13,760
Your Majesty,

156
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,720
well…

157
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,560
You little rascal.

158
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:21,480
You're reckless and out of control.

159
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:26,120
From now on, discipline yourself
and conduct yourself with dignity.

160
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:28,440
If you get out of line again,

161
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:30,240
I won't let you off lightly.

162
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:32,880
Yes.

163
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,520
As for this girl…

164
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:39,040
Your Majesty…

165
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:43,520
The Crown Prince
should cherish his brothers

166
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:44,560
and treat them with courtesy.

167
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:47,160
only then can he be a model for the realm.

168
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:49,920
It's only one woman.

169
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:52,880
Find him another suitable girl.

170
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:55,360
And you.

171
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:59,200
If your daughter has been wronged,
come to me for a fair judgment.

172
00:10:59,280 --> 00:11:01,440
You shouldn't have acted rashly

173
00:11:02,040 --> 00:11:03,920
and disgraced the imperial family.

174
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,120
Your punishment…

175
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:11,480
Both of you were at fault.

176
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:13,000
You'll each lose a year's allowance

177
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,880
and remain in
your palace for a month to reflect.

178
00:11:17,520 --> 00:11:18,720
Your Majesty is wise.

179
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:40,480
Was everything you said
at the banquet true?

180
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:44,000
Noble Lady Wu'an's
features foretell a noble destiny.

181
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:45,600
No, more than that.

182
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:49,200
Her authority will grow,
and the people will rally to her.

183
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:51,480
Wherever she directs her banner,
none will dare disobey.

184
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:53,840
Even the reigning Empress Dowager

185
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:55,640
doesn't have features like hers.

186
00:11:56,760 --> 00:11:59,240
But her ear rims turn outward,

187
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:01,200
and she has a fiery temper.

188
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:04,320
A flame that burns too
fiercely consumes its wick.

189
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,920
How can a candle like
that last long in the wind?

190
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:11,640
The fiercer the flame,
the sooner it burns out.

191
00:12:12,800 --> 00:12:14,520
She may enjoy great glory for a time,

192
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:16,720
but will never see past
her blossoming years.

193
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,680
Exactly.

194
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:21,640
The Crown Prince wanted a common girl.

195
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:23,760
She should have let him have her.
But she refused.

196
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:26,240
She's rebellious by nature.

197
00:12:27,880 --> 00:12:30,360
Now that you've seen her for yourself,
I can rest easy.

198
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,320
Marked for an early death

199
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,800
with the makings of a tyrant.

200
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:38,160
And she's a woman, no less.

201
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,040
What a pity.

202
00:12:40,880 --> 00:12:42,240
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

203
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:43,560
Hualou, please don't be angry.

204
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:45,880
I have a few things to say.
I'll leave once I've said them.

205
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:48,560
Grand Tutor Xie
enjoys an honorable reputation,

206
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:50,400
but your father holds
only the rank of viscount.

207
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:53,200
I'll ask Father to make him a marquis,

208
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:56,000
give 3000 jin of gold as a betrothal gift,

209
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:58,160
and expand the Xie family's
fief by a hundred li.

210
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:00,520
You truly want to marry me?

211
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,640
Then why did you ask for Hongxian?

212
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:06,000
Only to save her.

213
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:08,600
You come from a distinguished family,

214
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:10,920
act with sound judgment,
and carry yourself with grace.

215
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,840
Surely you can see
beyond petty matters of love, right?

216
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:18,680
You can take as
many concubines as you like.

217
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:20,240
It's just…

218
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:22,840
what if Hongxian becomes another Yi Jiang,

219
00:13:23,640 --> 00:13:24,880
and you lose your head over her one day…

220
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:30,720
I'm not Prince Fu.

221
00:13:31,400 --> 00:13:33,800
By custom, an emperor's son
who takes a principal wife

222
00:13:33,880 --> 00:13:34,720
can be granted a princely title.

223
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,680
You'll have the status of a prince's wife,

224
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:38,520
with all the honor
and dignity that entails.

225
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:41,240
I'll cherish you
and treat you well for life.

226
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:42,400
No other woman
will take precedence over you.

227
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,120
There.

228
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:46,080
I've said what I came to say.

229
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:47,240
Please, think this through.

230
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:49,920
Stop the carriage!

231
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:52,880
Wait.

232
00:13:56,800 --> 00:14:00,400
Alert your sister to be careful
with the Crown Princess.

233
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:02,920
She's been in contact with
some of the displaced from Ancheng.

234
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:06,000
All right.

235
00:14:06,520 --> 00:14:07,960
Once I've spoken to Father,

236
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:09,200
I'll visit your family at
once to ask for your hand.

237
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:24,160
SONGYUE HALL

238
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:26,240
- My Lord.
- Has Her Ladyship returned?

239
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:29,160
She has, but…

240
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:30,400
What's wrong?

241
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,320
Finished with military business?

242
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:54,840
I came back early
after inspecting the troops.

243
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:58,880
What happened at the palace?

244
00:15:00,520 --> 00:15:01,600
Nothing much.

245
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:05,320
Prince Fu's favorite concubine,
Yi Jiang, who is skilled at reading faces,

246
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:06,840
said I would face trials.

247
00:15:07,680 --> 00:15:09,520
All that mystical nonsense
and fearmongering

248
00:15:09,600 --> 00:15:10,800
was quite upsetting.

249
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:14,720
Is that what she said?

250
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:16,400
What else did she say?

251
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:19,000
Is Yi Jiang really that accurate?

252
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:21,000
Prince Fu dotes on her.

253
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:24,520
His travel dates,
clothes, carriages, and routes

254
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:25,800
all depend on her divinations.

255
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,800
He treats her like a fortune-teller.

256
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:31,920
Prince Fu really is foolish.

257
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,480
No wonder Xie Hualou wouldn't marry him.

258
00:15:33,560 --> 00:15:35,200
He isn't foolish.

259
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:37,360
Yi Jiang must have
some extraordinary ability.

260
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:41,560
Starting tomorrow,

261
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:43,640
take Zhao Song and
Zhao Bai whenever you go out.

262
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:45,680
You believe her too?

263
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:47,480
Your safety is at stake.

264
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:50,280
I'd rather take the warning seriously.
It's settled.

265
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:55,960
My Lord, you have a visitor.

266
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:58,320
Who's here?

267
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:00,840
It's probably military business.

268
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:02,560
I'll be right back.

269
00:16:12,880 --> 00:16:14,040
Aman.

270
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,520
Pack some valuables and money.

271
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:23,880
At the Zi hour tonight…

272
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:45,440
I've arranged a place for you to hide.

273
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:46,840
Xiao will be waiting there.

274
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,520
You'll leave the city at the Yin hour.

275
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:51,600
Don't ask questions.

276
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:53,280
Get in the carriage.

277
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,280
Hurry.

278
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:02,360
Don't move.

279
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:03,760
Stop!

280
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:07,400
Zhao Bai, put away your sword.

281
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:10,000
Hongxian, get in.

282
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:12,240
His Majesty has approved.

283
00:17:12,319 --> 00:17:14,200
Hongxian must marry the Fourth Prince.

284
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:16,520
Otherwise, if the truth comes out later,

285
00:17:17,119 --> 00:17:19,400
Lady Li and Liu Shuo
will both be implicated.

286
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:22,319
Don't worry about that. Get in.

287
00:17:26,760 --> 00:17:28,000
Why won't you listen?

288
00:17:28,079 --> 00:17:29,360
I'm telling you to leave!

289
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,520
Wei Rao!

290
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:37,560
Fine.

291
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,160
Have it your way.

292
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:42,440
I'm done looking after you.

293
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:17,920
We're not related by blood,
yet you've caused me so much trouble.

294
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:19,600
I should never have meddled.

295
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:21,880
I should have sent you away long ago.

296
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:25,400
From now on, I won't concern myself
whether you live or die,

297
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:40,480
Liu Shuo will take a wife
from a suitable noble family.

298
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:43,760
Even if he favors you for my sake,

299
00:18:43,840 --> 00:18:46,000
you'll still be a lowly concubine.

300
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:48,280
Think of Madam Ge in the tenement.

301
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:50,840
Simply because of her beautiful eyes,

302
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:54,000
the principal wife grew jealous
and blinded her.

303
00:18:55,600 --> 00:18:58,640
You can't even cry out in pain.
How can I possibly not worry?

304
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:05,720
You worked yourself to
the bone to feed our family.

305
00:19:05,800 --> 00:19:09,800
I always thought that once I grew up,

306
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:12,080
I'd be willing to become a concubine,

307
00:19:12,840 --> 00:19:14,600
even a slave or a prostitute,

308
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:18,200
so you wouldn't
have to work so hard again.

309
00:19:19,040 --> 00:19:20,120
Hongxian…

310
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:22,400
As a prince's concubine,

311
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:25,160
I won't go hungry again.

312
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:27,160
That's a good thing.

313
00:19:28,280 --> 00:19:29,440
I don't want to leave.

314
00:19:30,040 --> 00:19:33,120
Those who trampled on me
must pay for what they did.

315
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:34,320
I have to see it.

316
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,000
Until then, even in death,

317
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:38,120
I won't rest in peace.

318
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:42,960
Are you sure?

319
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:48,120
Very well.

320
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:55,240
Do you know
why I provoked Lady Zheng today?

321
00:19:57,640 --> 00:20:00,520
First, to get us out of there quickly.

322
00:20:01,040 --> 00:20:02,000
Second,

323
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:05,360
who do you think

324
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:08,600
most longs for the Emperor's death?

325
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:12,320
The Crown Prince and his mother.

326
00:20:14,320 --> 00:20:15,600
The more impatient they are,

327
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:18,200
the more likely they are to make mistakes.

328
00:20:18,920 --> 00:20:20,600
An ant can hardly topple a great tree,

329
00:20:22,120 --> 00:20:23,600
but termites can hollow it out.

330
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,160
Don't worry.

331
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:29,160
I won't forget what they did to you.

332
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:32,800
I won't forget those girls he abused.

333
00:20:46,200 --> 00:20:47,720
<i>Why did avoid your sister?</i>

334
00:20:48,800 --> 00:20:50,840
My sister and I have
only recently become family.

335
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:52,520
She's far closer to Hongxian than to me.

336
00:20:53,040 --> 00:20:54,840
I only asked to
marry Hongxian to save her,

337
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:57,600
but she may think
I have an ulterior motive.

338
00:20:58,400 --> 00:20:59,840
You really have feelings for Hongxian?

339
00:21:01,360 --> 00:21:04,040
In this palace, there's every kind
of beauty you can imagine.

340
00:21:04,840 --> 00:21:06,760
My sister has
always kept me at a distance.

341
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:08,720
Hongxian is her foster sister.

342
00:21:09,360 --> 00:21:12,600
I approached Hongxian
to learn more about my sister's past.

343
00:21:13,200 --> 00:21:14,600
I also wanted to understand

344
00:21:14,680 --> 00:21:17,080
why my sister cared for her so much,
so protective of her.

345
00:21:17,920 --> 00:21:20,440
By chance, it ended
in a marriage arrangement.

346
00:21:22,520 --> 00:21:24,600
Lord Lu, I'll be direct.

347
00:21:24,680 --> 00:21:26,560
I came to say just two things.

348
00:21:27,280 --> 00:21:30,080
First, there's
something uncanny about Yi Jiang.

349
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:31,120
Her readings are never wrong.

350
00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:33,200
You must warn my sister to be careful.

351
00:21:33,280 --> 00:21:36,640
- I will.
- Second, the Crown Prince…

352
00:21:36,720 --> 00:21:38,720
He's about to make a move.
We should be on our guard.

353
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:54,800
Forgive me, Your Ladyship.

354
00:21:55,520 --> 00:21:56,360
Get out!

355
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:58,840
All of you, get out!

356
00:21:58,920 --> 00:22:02,800
BLOSSOMS NESTLED IN DEW

357
00:22:11,120 --> 00:22:14,040
Mother, let me do it.

358
00:22:27,320 --> 00:22:30,600
Wei Rao is arrogant, but she wasn't wrong.

359
00:22:31,360 --> 00:22:32,760
His Majesty's affection has faded.

360
00:22:32,840 --> 00:22:34,240
You've long been out of favor.

361
00:22:34,320 --> 00:22:36,160
Becoming Empress is
now an impossible dream.

362
00:22:36,680 --> 00:22:38,880
You'd do better to
support the Crown Prince.

363
00:22:40,040 --> 00:22:40,920
How dare you!

364
00:22:41,520 --> 00:22:43,120
Who are you to say such things?

365
00:22:46,320 --> 00:22:47,400
In this world,

366
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:51,280
the Crown Prince
is the only one you can rely on.

367
00:22:58,000 --> 00:23:01,080
Is His Majesty still taking medicine?

368
00:23:02,120 --> 00:23:03,240
Why do you ask?

369
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:08,520
Wu'an's insolence
has made you ill with distress.

370
00:23:08,600 --> 00:23:10,000
To silence the gossip,

371
00:23:10,600 --> 00:23:13,840
His Majesty will surely visit you often.

372
00:23:18,520 --> 00:23:20,640
When the late Emperor died,

373
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:23,160
the lives of his consorts

374
00:23:23,760 --> 00:23:25,560
were entirely at
the Empress Dowager's mercy.

375
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:28,080
Lady Li is in favor
only because of her beauty.

376
00:23:28,160 --> 00:23:29,520
How long can her good fortune last?

377
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:34,160
Your Ladyship, just keep your composure

378
00:23:35,040 --> 00:23:36,800
and be patient.

379
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:48,000
Say no more.

380
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:51,720
Let me think it over.

381
00:23:52,520 --> 00:23:55,120
<i>Are you sure you can persuade Mother?</i>

382
00:23:56,040 --> 00:23:58,400
<i>Who could resist the chance</i>

383
00:23:58,480 --> 00:24:00,920
<i>to wield power in Weiyang Palace</i>

384
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:03,240
<i>and hold all of Chang'an in their grasp?</i>

385
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:05,360
HENGCHENG GATE

386
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:06,520
Lord Han,

387
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:08,840
what did the Empress Dowager say?

388
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:12,320
She deeply resents all
three of the Zhou family.

389
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:13,520
The plan will certainly work.

390
00:24:14,120 --> 00:24:15,120
However…

391
00:24:15,960 --> 00:24:17,080
Once we succeed,

392
00:24:17,160 --> 00:24:19,920
the Crown Prince will strip
the Lu family of military power,

393
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:22,040
promote you to General-in-Chief,

394
00:24:22,120 --> 00:24:24,680
and give your family
back its lands and title.

395
00:24:25,320 --> 00:24:26,480
Good.

396
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:30,600
The Han family will serve the Crown Prince

397
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:33,400
and gladly give our lives for him.

398
00:24:38,600 --> 00:24:40,400
How do you plan to deal with Wei Rao?

399
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:44,640
Noble Lady Wu'an saves those in peril
and is widely revered.

400
00:24:45,160 --> 00:24:46,960
Zhuyu Estate has become a haven.

401
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:51,200
But branches can
grow too heavy for a tree,

402
00:24:51,280 --> 00:24:52,240
and an estate too large to control.

403
00:24:52,840 --> 00:24:54,280
Her greatest strength

404
00:24:54,360 --> 00:24:58,760
will also be her fatal weakness.

405
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:05,560
ZHAO

406
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:10,200
Nice!

407
00:25:10,280 --> 00:25:11,440
Go, General Qi!

408
00:25:11,520 --> 00:25:12,560
- Nice blow!
- Go, General Qi!

409
00:25:12,640 --> 00:25:13,640
Go, General Qi!

410
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:16,160
- Come on.
- Go, General Qi!

411
00:25:16,240 --> 00:25:19,880
Yes!

412
00:25:19,960 --> 00:25:22,440
- Go, General Qi!
- Go, General Qi!

413
00:25:22,520 --> 00:25:23,800
- General Qi!
- Well done!

414
00:25:23,880 --> 00:25:25,000
Go, General Qi!

415
00:25:25,600 --> 00:25:26,560
Keep it up!

416
00:25:26,640 --> 00:25:28,800
Nice!

417
00:25:28,880 --> 00:25:29,880
General Qi!

418
00:25:29,960 --> 00:25:31,360
- Go, General Qi!
- Wonderful!

419
00:25:31,440 --> 00:25:32,600
- Nice blow!
- Keep going!

420
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:34,880
- General Qi!
- General Qi!

421
00:25:34,960 --> 00:25:36,760
- I'll spar with you!
- Go, General Qi!

422
00:25:36,840 --> 00:25:37,840
That's our General Qi!

423
00:25:41,880 --> 00:25:48,080
- Victory!
- Victory!

424
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:49,400
General Qi will win!

425
00:25:49,480 --> 00:25:55,520
- You'll win!
- You'll win!

426
00:25:58,800 --> 00:26:00,440
General Qi will win!

427
00:26:00,520 --> 00:26:04,800
Victory!

428
00:26:05,760 --> 00:26:07,400
Great moves, General Qi!

429
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:11,920
- Nice!
- Fantastic!

430
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:15,320
Victory!

431
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:16,440
Great moves, General Lu!

432
00:26:16,520 --> 00:26:18,120
Victory!

433
00:26:18,200 --> 00:26:20,080
What are you staring at?
Don't you have drills to do?

434
00:26:20,680 --> 00:26:22,120
Move along! Break it up!

435
00:26:22,200 --> 00:26:23,840
- Let's go. Come on.
- Let's go. Come on.

436
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:25,720
- That was quite a fight!
- It was.

437
00:26:25,800 --> 00:26:27,320
- They're far better than us.
- They are.

438
00:26:27,400 --> 00:26:28,560
General Qi was incredible.

439
00:26:55,640 --> 00:26:56,520
Qi Zhongkai, what's wrong with you?

440
00:26:56,600 --> 00:26:58,120
You smell like her incense.

441
00:26:58,640 --> 00:26:59,760
You're clearly showing off.

442
00:26:59,840 --> 00:27:01,160
I should've hit you a few more times.

443
00:27:01,240 --> 00:27:02,360
I'm not.

444
00:27:08,800 --> 00:27:11,520
Perhaps the maids
used it to scent my clothes.

445
00:27:11,600 --> 00:27:13,120
Who do you think you're fooling?

446
00:27:17,760 --> 00:27:18,920
Qi Zhongkai.

447
00:27:19,600 --> 00:27:20,640
Zhongkai!

448
00:27:21,800 --> 00:27:24,920
How long are you going to stay angry?

449
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:32,960
My Lord, Zhuyu Estate is taking
in refugees this morning.

450
00:27:35,760 --> 00:27:36,960
Have the horses prepared.

451
00:27:48,840 --> 00:27:49,920
ZHUYU ESTATE

452
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:51,200
Keep moving.

453
00:27:51,280 --> 00:27:52,680
Give us your name.

454
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:54,680
- All right, go ahead.
- Move along. Go ahead.

455
00:27:54,760 --> 00:27:55,880
- Move along.
- Go ahead.

456
00:27:57,200 --> 00:27:58,560
- Move along. Come on.
- Line up!

457
00:27:58,640 --> 00:27:59,640
Step up here. Line up!

458
00:28:03,040 --> 00:28:05,240
Once you've registered,
move ahead. There's food up front.

459
00:28:06,920 --> 00:28:07,760
Off you go.

460
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:14,680
- Don't rush. One at a time.
- There's enough for everyone.

461
00:28:14,760 --> 00:28:15,760
Here you are.

462
00:28:15,840 --> 00:28:17,280
Keep moving at the back.

463
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:21,360
- Lodgings are over there.
- All right, next.

464
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:23,320
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

465
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:24,560
- Keep moving.
- Here.

466
00:28:24,640 --> 00:28:26,520
- Here you are.
- Thank you!

467
00:28:26,600 --> 00:28:28,080
- Thank you.
- Be careful. It's hot.

468
00:28:28,680 --> 00:28:29,840
Here you are.

469
00:28:30,440 --> 00:28:31,480
- There's enough for everyone.
- Here.

470
00:28:31,560 --> 00:28:32,720
Keep moving at the back.

471
00:28:32,800 --> 00:28:33,640
Here.

472
00:28:34,160 --> 00:28:35,200
- Give me some.
- Here's yours.

473
00:28:35,280 --> 00:28:36,240
Is the child ill?

474
00:28:36,800 --> 00:28:40,160
Your Ladyship, my granddaughter is sick.

475
00:28:40,240 --> 00:28:41,120
Those at the back!

476
00:28:41,200 --> 00:28:43,280
Please bless her.

477
00:28:43,360 --> 00:28:45,080
- There's more over here.
- Don't believe the rumors.

478
00:28:45,600 --> 00:28:46,840
I'm only human.

479
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:49,000
If your child is ill,
take her to a physician.

480
00:28:53,920 --> 00:28:55,480
Don't touch her!

481
00:29:07,920 --> 00:29:09,720
A spring epidemic
has broken out in Ancheng.

482
00:29:09,800 --> 00:29:10,880
Countless people have fallen ill
or died in the past half month.

483
00:29:11,840 --> 00:29:14,760
Prince Fu ordered the city gates shut.
These people fled from Ancheng.

484
00:29:16,120 --> 00:29:19,520
That's not true! No!

485
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:22,280
What's wrong?

486
00:29:22,360 --> 00:29:23,840
What happened?

487
00:29:23,920 --> 00:29:25,040
Wake up!

488
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:32,320
Take them away.

489
00:29:32,400 --> 00:29:34,840
Some great savior you are!

490
00:29:34,920 --> 00:29:37,040
My granddaughter is dying,

491
00:29:37,120 --> 00:29:40,040
yet you heartlessly turn us away!

492
00:29:40,640 --> 00:29:43,480
What kind of living saint are you?

493
00:29:43,560 --> 00:29:47,760
You're a murderer,
a demon who brings death!

494
00:29:47,840 --> 00:29:49,280
Look, everyone! She's a murderous demon!

495
00:29:49,360 --> 00:29:50,760
There's nothing kind about her!

496
00:29:50,840 --> 00:29:53,200
- And people think she's a living saint.
- Zhao Song.

497
00:29:53,280 --> 00:29:55,760
She makes me sick!

498
00:29:55,840 --> 00:29:56,800
She's cruel and vicious.

499
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:59,040
- Don't let her fool you!
- You monster!

500
00:29:59,120 --> 00:30:01,720
You let infected people in.
Are you trying to kill everyone?

501
00:30:03,320 --> 00:30:04,960
- Who told you to do this?
- Qi Zhongkai,

502
00:30:05,600 --> 00:30:06,880
this isn't the place.

503
00:30:07,560 --> 00:30:08,720
Take him away.

504
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:12,960
I… I don't know anything!

505
00:30:13,040 --> 00:30:14,520
I really don't!

506
00:30:16,240 --> 00:30:18,640
The illness comes on quickly
and hits hard.

507
00:30:18,720 --> 00:30:20,280
Ancheng is so far away.

508
00:30:20,840 --> 00:30:22,400
How could they have made it here on foot?

509
00:30:22,960 --> 00:30:24,400
Someone clearly brought them in carriages.

510
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:26,440
Detain them.

511
00:30:26,520 --> 00:30:28,360
Check everyone again.

512
00:30:28,440 --> 00:30:30,800
Look for anyone with a pale
or bluish face, trembling hands or feet,

513
00:30:30,880 --> 00:30:33,680
fever, or convulsions.
Don't miss a single one.

514
00:30:33,760 --> 00:30:34,960
Have them leave.

515
00:30:35,480 --> 00:30:36,360
Yes.

516
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:38,400
- Murderous demon!
- Hurry!

517
00:30:38,480 --> 00:30:40,000
- Murderous demon!
- Move! Hurry!

518
00:30:40,080 --> 00:30:41,520
Out! Get out!

519
00:30:42,320 --> 00:30:43,440
- Hurry!
- Get out!

520
00:30:43,960 --> 00:30:45,080
- Hurry!
- Out!

521
00:30:45,160 --> 00:30:46,280
Move!

522
00:30:46,360 --> 00:30:47,200
Hurry!

523
00:30:47,280 --> 00:30:50,480
- Murderous demon!
- Get out!

524
00:30:51,680 --> 00:30:52,800
Move along!

525
00:30:52,880 --> 00:30:53,840
Move!

526
00:30:55,280 --> 00:30:56,320
- Hurry!
- Move!

527
00:30:56,920 --> 00:30:58,800
- Move!
- Why aren't you stopping her?

528
00:30:59,400 --> 00:31:00,840
You can't stop her.

529
00:31:00,920 --> 00:31:01,840
Just stay out of her way.

530
00:31:04,520 --> 00:31:05,520
Don't cry.

531
00:31:06,160 --> 00:31:07,600
I'll buy you some sweets.

532
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:14,400
Everyone, stay calm.

533
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:17,200
Anyone who's ill must have
their symptoms recorded accurately.

534
00:31:17,720 --> 00:31:19,440
I'll set up quarters for the sick,

535
00:31:20,040 --> 00:31:23,080
provide food and water every day,
and send physicians and medicinal herbs.

536
00:31:24,040 --> 00:31:27,280
With proper care,
everyone will be well again.

537
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:32,280
- Thank you, Your Ladyship!
- Thank you, Your Ladyship!

538
00:31:33,000 --> 00:31:34,200
Now that you've come here,

539
00:31:34,840 --> 00:31:37,200
you're my people
and deserve my protection.

540
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:39,800
Take the child to a physician.

541
00:31:41,160 --> 00:31:42,240
Thank you.

542
00:31:43,600 --> 00:31:45,480
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

543
00:31:46,120 --> 00:31:47,680
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

544
00:31:47,760 --> 00:31:49,040
Her Ladyship acts by Heaven's will,

545
00:31:49,120 --> 00:31:51,560
saving lives and
easing the people's suffering.

546
00:31:51,640 --> 00:31:53,560
May Heaven protect Her Ladyship,

547
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:56,320
and may her kindness
bless the entire realm!

548
00:31:59,200 --> 00:32:05,040
May Heaven bless Her Ladyship
with good fortune and a long life!

549
00:32:05,120 --> 00:32:09,920
May she live long
and bless all the people!

550
00:32:10,000 --> 00:32:11,000
Everyone, get up!

551
00:32:13,040 --> 00:32:15,480
Please stop kneeling! Get up!

552
00:32:18,680 --> 00:32:20,240
Aman, go into the city

553
00:32:20,320 --> 00:32:22,240
and bring every physician
skilled in treating epidemics.

554
00:32:22,320 --> 00:32:23,360
Hurry.

555
00:32:23,440 --> 00:32:24,320
Yes.

556
00:32:25,920 --> 00:32:28,040
- Line up!
- Form a line!

557
00:32:28,120 --> 00:32:29,560
- Get in line!
- Hurry!

558
00:32:29,640 --> 00:32:31,520
- Line up!
- One at a time!

559
00:32:32,040 --> 00:32:33,160
Unbelievable.

560
00:32:33,760 --> 00:32:36,040
People keep exploiting
her kindness to cause trouble,

561
00:32:36,120 --> 00:32:37,880
only to help her rise even higher.

562
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:38,960
What's so surprising?

563
00:32:39,560 --> 00:32:43,360
I imagine whoever's behind this
must be furious right now.

564
00:32:43,440 --> 00:32:46,200
I don't know whether they're furious.

565
00:32:46,280 --> 00:32:50,000
All I know is
you two scared me half to death.

566
00:33:04,560 --> 00:33:07,680
Turning everything to her advantage.

567
00:33:08,920 --> 00:33:10,880
that is who she truly is.

568
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:26,040
Stop.

569
00:33:26,120 --> 00:33:27,960
You'd better tell the truth

570
00:33:28,480 --> 00:33:29,880
and spare yourself more pain.

571
00:33:29,960 --> 00:33:33,120
I was only trying to help
by letting them into the estate.

572
00:33:33,200 --> 00:33:35,920
How was I to know
which people had the plague?

573
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:38,240
I really don't know anything.

574
00:33:38,320 --> 00:33:40,400
I'm innocent!

575
00:33:41,280 --> 00:33:42,520
Stubborn, aren't you?

576
00:33:44,400 --> 00:33:47,160
You won't talk unless we torture you.

577
00:33:47,240 --> 00:33:48,200
Qi Zhongkai!

578
00:33:54,960 --> 00:33:56,880
Don't bother. Take him out.

579
00:33:58,200 --> 00:34:00,080
Lu Zhuo, you're letting him go?

580
00:34:08,920 --> 00:34:12,400
Thank you, Lord Lu, for giving me justice.

581
00:34:12,480 --> 00:34:14,440
I'll never forget your kindness.

582
00:34:14,520 --> 00:34:15,760
Lu Zhuo!

583
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:18,679
Since we can't get anything out of him,
why waste time?

584
00:34:20,360 --> 00:34:22,159
Let the people decide his fate.

585
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:26,040
Whether he's torn apart by chariots
or stoned to death

586
00:34:26,120 --> 00:34:27,560
will depend on his luck.

587
00:34:27,639 --> 00:34:29,239
- Lord… Lord Lu!
- Take him away.

588
00:34:29,320 --> 00:34:31,679
Lord Lu!

589
00:34:31,760 --> 00:34:33,480
I really don't know anything!

590
00:34:33,560 --> 00:34:35,199
Lord Lu, I'll talk!

591
00:34:39,639 --> 00:34:41,080
Lord Lu, I'll talk.

592
00:34:41,159 --> 00:34:44,560
Someone gave me two gold pellets
and told me

593
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:46,800
to let them in.

594
00:34:47,679 --> 00:34:49,880
But I didn't recognize him.

595
00:34:49,960 --> 00:34:52,199
I'd never seen him before.

596
00:34:52,280 --> 00:34:53,840
I've told you everything I know.

597
00:34:53,920 --> 00:34:55,880
Spare me, Lord Lu! Spare me!

598
00:34:55,960 --> 00:34:57,960
Give him 50 strokes of
the rod and hold him for now.

599
00:34:58,560 --> 00:35:00,680
Lord Lu, I told you everything. Please!

600
00:35:00,760 --> 00:35:02,880
Lord Lu!

601
00:35:02,960 --> 00:35:04,280
I should've known.

602
00:35:04,800 --> 00:35:08,320
Who but that petty Crown Prince,
who's unworthy of his position,

603
00:35:08,400 --> 00:35:10,960
would do something so vile?

604
00:35:12,600 --> 00:35:15,240
General Qi,
you're no longer angry with me?

605
00:35:17,760 --> 00:35:19,160
I can do the math too.

606
00:35:19,680 --> 00:35:21,920
Falling out with
you would cost me two friends.

607
00:35:22,520 --> 00:35:23,960
I won't make such a bad bargain.

608
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:28,200
I've sworn
to find someone better than Wei Rao.

609
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:34,280
My wife
must surpass her in both wit and virtue.

610
00:35:34,960 --> 00:35:39,400
Otherwise, I'd rather never marry
than settle for any less.

611
00:35:41,160 --> 00:35:42,320
I'm leaving.

612
00:35:53,400 --> 00:35:57,400
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

613
00:36:22,880 --> 00:36:25,480
Don't worry, Rao.
I'll treat Hongxian well.

614
00:36:25,560 --> 00:36:27,880
In three days,
I'll bring her back to see you.

615
00:36:53,840 --> 00:36:55,200
When a girl marries,

616
00:36:56,120 --> 00:36:57,680
her brother helps her into the carriage.

617
00:36:58,280 --> 00:36:59,800
Your own brother is good for nothing,

618
00:36:59,880 --> 00:37:01,600
I sent him to the army to be tempered.

619
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:05,320
Today, let Xiao help you instead.

620
00:37:06,160 --> 00:37:07,800
It's for good luck.

621
00:37:10,000 --> 00:37:10,880
Come here.

622
00:37:23,720 --> 00:37:24,640
Go on.

623
00:39:07,080 --> 00:39:08,560
Hongxian is of humble birth.

624
00:39:08,640 --> 00:39:11,280
She'll have to settle for the rank now.

625
00:39:12,360 --> 00:39:14,640
Once she's had a child in a year or two,

626
00:39:15,320 --> 00:39:18,000
you can ask
His Majesty to grant her a title.

627
00:39:18,080 --> 00:39:20,320
Then she'll have
a bright future ahead of her.

628
00:39:22,240 --> 00:39:24,440
Don't worry. Let's go inside.

629
00:39:35,240 --> 00:39:37,640
My Lord, why don't you go over?

630
00:39:38,520 --> 00:39:40,720
It's all right. Let's go.

631
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:25,040
It's beautiful.

632
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:36,920
<i>You've kept forcing my hand.</i>

633
00:40:37,000 --> 00:40:38,440
<i>Don't blame me for what comes next.</i>

634
00:40:40,120 --> 00:40:41,880
<i>But I mustn't act rashly.</i>

635
00:40:43,000 --> 00:40:44,080
<i>Wei Rao,</i>

636
00:40:44,880 --> 00:40:46,560
<i>stay calm</i>

637
00:40:54,120 --> 00:40:55,280
Did I wake you?

638
00:40:58,680 --> 00:41:00,720
- I wanted to say…
- I know.

639
00:41:04,360 --> 00:41:05,680
You know what I want to say?

640
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:10,400
You want to say,
with sick refugees entering the capital,

641
00:41:11,160 --> 00:41:13,040
Grandfather and
Grandmother getting on in years,

642
00:41:13,120 --> 00:41:16,480
you plan to move to the estate
as a precaution.

643
00:41:19,840 --> 00:41:20,680
And you agree?

644
00:41:23,040 --> 00:41:24,360
I'll move there with you.

645
00:41:25,240 --> 00:41:26,840
We'll tell the elders together tomorrow.

646
00:41:31,200 --> 00:41:32,440
What I meant was…

647
00:41:32,520 --> 00:41:34,000
I joined the army at thirteen

648
00:41:35,040 --> 00:41:36,680
and crossed countless dangerous lands.

649
00:41:36,760 --> 00:41:39,400
I've seen plenty
of deadly fevers and plagues.

650
00:41:39,920 --> 00:41:41,520
I have more experience handling them.

651
00:41:42,480 --> 00:41:43,600
That's one reason.

652
00:41:43,680 --> 00:41:45,520
An epidemic spreads rapidly.

653
00:41:45,600 --> 00:41:46,720
From one person,

654
00:41:46,800 --> 00:41:49,000
it can spread to a household,
a village, then a whole town

655
00:41:49,680 --> 00:41:51,040
in just two months.

656
00:41:52,200 --> 00:41:53,960
Whoever let
infected people into the capital

657
00:41:55,080 --> 00:41:56,200
isn't merely targeting you.

658
00:41:58,520 --> 00:42:00,640
They may have some other scheme in mind.

659
00:42:01,520 --> 00:42:02,560
I must stay vigilant.

660
00:42:03,280 --> 00:42:05,040
Someone wants to
throw the capital into chaos?

661
00:42:05,120 --> 00:42:06,000
What's more…

662
00:42:11,160 --> 00:42:12,400
Let's sleep.

663
00:42:12,480 --> 00:42:14,480
You haven't told me your third reason.

664
00:42:21,120 --> 00:42:22,120
I can't bear to be apart from you.

665
00:42:28,720 --> 00:42:30,160
Lu Zhuo, I want to…

666
00:42:30,240 --> 00:42:31,520
Whatever you're planning,

667
00:42:32,640 --> 00:42:33,520
don't tell me.

668
00:42:35,960 --> 00:42:38,040
I serve the Emperor
and owe him my loyalty.

669
00:42:38,560 --> 00:42:41,120
There are some things
I'm better off not knowing.

670
00:42:43,200 --> 00:42:44,440
Whatever you want to do,

671
00:42:44,960 --> 00:42:46,280
go ahead and do it.

672
00:42:47,080 --> 00:42:50,040
All my men are yours to command.

673
00:42:52,360 --> 00:42:53,400
Really?

674
00:42:58,720 --> 00:43:00,360
Then I'm going to do something

675
00:43:01,800 --> 00:43:03,920
that will shake the realm.

676
00:45:16,120 --> 00:45:18,840
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
